<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Panamerican Beverages.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Panamerican Beverages.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co confirmed that it upgraded  Panamerican Beverages Inc to outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Oppenheimer analyst Enrique Figueroa said he is likely to raise his earnings estimates on the company after a conference call with Panamerican management Monday morning.</p>
<p>-- set a new price target of $59 a share.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
